T*
(APEXCARE INDIA EMPLOYEE HEALTH BENEFIT PROGRAMME \(AIEHBP\)) Tj
T*
(MASTER GROUP HEALTH POLICY WORDING) Tj
T*
(============================================================================================) Tj
T*
(Demonstration Version 1.0 | Effective date: 01 April 2026) Tj
T*
(Document code: AIEHBP-POL-001) Tj
T*
(Primary audience: Members, HR, insurer, TPA and claims teams) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(FICTIONAL TRAINING DOCUMENT - NOT AN INSURANCE CONTRACT. This document is a synthetic) Tj
T*
(example created for software development, retrieval testing, and claims-workflow) Tj
T*
(demonstrations. A real insurer, employer, TPA, legal team, medical team, and compliance) Tj
T*
(function must review and approve all wording, benefits, timelines, forms, and regulatory) Tj
T*
(references before operational use.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Document-control rule: cite the document code, section, clause, page, and version in every decision.) Tj
T*
(Interpretation rule: the signed policy schedule and endorsements override this demonstration text.) Tj
T*
(============================================================================================) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
