(2. ELIGIBILITY, ENROLLMENT AND COVER PERIOD) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Coverage depends on validated enrollment and dates.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(POL-2.1  Eligible employees) Tj
T*
(   A permanent employee listed by the policyholder and accepted in the enrollment file is) Tj
T*
(   eligible from the effective date communicated in the member certificate.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(POL-2.2  Eligible dependants) Tj
T*
(   Eligible dependants may include one lawful spouse or declared partner, dependent children) Tj
T*
(   from birth through age twenty-five while meeting dependency rules, and parents or) Tj
T*
(   parents-in-law only when the schedule expressly includes them.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(POL-2.3  New joiners and newborns) Tj
T*
(   New employees and newly eligible dependants must be enrolled within the employer) Tj
T*
(   notification window. A newborn may receive cover from birth when maternity/newborn cover) Tj
T*
(   is active and notification is received within thirty days.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(POL-2.4  Termination) Tj
T*
(   Cover ends on the earliest of policy expiry, termination recorded by the policyholder,) Tj
T*
(   exhaustion where restoration does not apply, or another date shown in an endorsement.) Tj
T*
(   Treatment after termination is not covered merely because symptoms began earlier.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(POL-2.5  Identity mismatch) Tj
T*
(   Minor spelling differences may be resolved using government identity, employee records) Tj
T*
(   and hospital records. Material mismatch must be investigated; mismatch alone is not proof) Tj
T*
(   of fraud.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
