(5. MATERNITY, NEWBORN AND SPECIAL BENEFITS) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Special benefits have independent limits and conditions.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(POL-5.1  Maternity) Tj
T*
(   Hospital expenses for childbirth, including medically necessary caesarean delivery, are) Tj
T*
(   covered only when maternity is active and the member satisfies the waiting period or an) Tj
T*
(   endorsement waives it.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(POL-5.2  Newborn care) Tj
T*
(   A newborn is covered from birth up to the maternity/newborn sublimit for medically) Tj
T*
(   necessary care when timely enrollment is completed. Congenital conditions are assessed) Tj
T*
(   under the schedule and applicable law, not automatically excluded.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(POL-5.3  Infertility and assisted reproduction) Tj
T*
(   Investigation or treatment of infertility, sterilisation reversal and assisted) Tj
T*
(   reproductive technology are excluded unless a signed endorsement expressly includes them.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(POL-5.4  Mental healthcare) Tj
T*
(   Medically necessary mental healthcare is assessed under the same core principles and any) Tj
T*
(   schedule-specific limits. A diagnosis must not be rejected solely because it is) Tj
T*
(   psychiatric.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(POL-5.5  Modern treatment methods) Tj
T*
(   Listed modern treatment methods are eligible subject to medical necessity, schedule) Tj
T*
(   sublimits and applicable authorization. The method must not be rejected merely because it) Tj
T*
(   uses newer technology.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
endstream
