(6. LIMITS, COST SHARING AND CALCULATION) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Benefits are calculated after eligibility and exclusion review.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(POL-6.1  Sum insured) Tj
T*
(   The family floater sum insured is shared by enrolled family members. The available) Tj
T*
(   balance is measured on the admission date and adjusted for earlier accepted claims.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(POL-6.2  Room eligibility) Tj
T*
(   Room and ICU eligibility follow the schedule. Where a proportionate deduction applies, it) Tj
T*
(   must be calculated only according to the schedule and must exclude items that do not vary) Tj
T*
(   with room category.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(POL-6.3  Deductible) Tj
T*
(   A deductible is the eligible amount borne by the member before insurer payment. It is not) Tj
T*
(   applied when the schedule states NIL.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(POL-6.4  Co-payment) Tj
T*
(   Co-payment is the percentage of an otherwise admissible amount borne by the member. It is) Tj
T*
(   applied after non-payable items, sublimits and deductible unless an endorsement states) Tj
T*
(   otherwise.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(POL-6.5  Restoration) Tj
T*
(   Restoration replenishes the sum insured only under the trigger and reuse conditions in) Tj
T*
(   the schedule. It cannot increase a benefit-specific sublimit.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(POL-6.6  Other insurance) Tj
T*
(   When another policy covers the same event, coordination must follow applicable) Tj
T*
(   contribution rules and the member may select a primary policy where permitted. Original) Tj
T*
(   document handling must be recorded.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
endstream
