(8. GENERAL INTERPRETATION AND SAFEGUARDS) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(These safeguards apply across all claims.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(POL-8.1  Conflict or ambiguity) Tj
T*
(   Conflicting clauses, missing endorsements or uncertain scope require manual review. The) Tj
T*
(   system must not select whichever clause produces the lowest payment.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(POL-8.2  Fraud allegation) Tj
T*
(   A discrepancy or red flag triggers verification; it does not by itself prove fraud. An) Tj
T*
(   adverse fraud decision requires documented evidence and authorized review.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(POL-8.3  Clinical judgement) Tj
T*
(   Automated extraction or similarity scores cannot replace required medical review for) Tj
T*
(   necessity, causation, coding, experimental status or complex comorbidity.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(POL-8.4  Human oversight) Tj
T*
(   No generative model may issue a final adverse decision without the controls, evidence and) Tj
T*
(   approval authority defined in AIEHBP-SOP-006.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
endstream
