(9. DEFINITIONS) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Defined terms should be attached to relevant chunks during retrieval.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(POL-9.1  Accident) Tj
T*
(   A sudden, unforeseen and involuntary event caused by external, visible and violent means.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(POL-9.2  Hospital) Tj
T*
(   An institution legally registered to provide in-patient care with qualified nursing and) Tj
T*
(   medical supervision, records, beds and required facilities.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(POL-9.3  Illness) Tj
T*
(   A sickness or disease first manifesting or requiring treatment during the coverage) Tj
T*
(   period, subject to waiting-period rules.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(POL-9.4  Pre-existing disease) Tj
T*
(   A condition diagnosed, treated, advised, or showing relevant signs or symptoms before the) Tj
T*
(   first continuous coverage date, assessed using applicable policy and regulatory) Tj
T*
(   definitions.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(POL-9.5  Registered medical practitioner) Tj
T*
(   A person validly registered with the appropriate medical council and acting within the) Tj
T*
(   lawful scope of practice.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(POL-9.6  Network provider) Tj
T*
(   A provider contracted for cashless service for the relevant policy and date; network) Tj
T*
(   status does not guarantee that every treatment is covered.) Tj
T*
